{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再等一个不会伤到任何东西的办法，接着做眼前该做的事，久违的昂扬又回来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"久违的昂扬\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再逼自己每次尽力都得扭转局面，能做多少就先做到多少。\",\n      \"key\": \"扭转局面\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得那种不必时时防备的生活，也愿意为护住它承担眼前的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"护住它\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"想到争取也可能伤到自己想要的生活，他又有些拿不准，仍按自己的决定往前做。\",\n      \"key\": \"按自己的决定\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留放弃无损等待、重新行动和昂扬回归；把不否认脆弱落实为想到争取可能伤到所爱时仍会犹疑，却继续行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"把不要求努力证明自己能改变一切，改成不再逼自己每次尽力都扭转局面。保留行动有力量却不能解决所有问题的认识，也接住过去硬撑到疲惫的经历。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R62\", \"R63\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-3\", \"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并分开\",\n      \"why\": \"把舍不得的东西具体写成不必时时防备的生活，把愿意负责落实为愿为护住它承担眼前的事；对可能失去它的担心则放在S12-4，保留承认牵挂并把牵挂纳入行动的变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-3\", \"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留决心仍然热烈、却不必等犹疑消失才成立。它的踏实来自知道自己为何承担，也来自想到代价仍按决定行动，不再用抽象的前后对照宣布变化。同时补足B3中短暂犹疑又继续向前的段内变化。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2702595b-5bb1-46b1-b8bf-757ab83125a4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T011403722221Z", "elapsed_seconds": 108.062, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:15:51.798388+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "887e95ef1663ac372f211b9685a5f01ccc6dfe1d715520da5946adf5e36f8bac", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc